  * Reported by Alexandre Oliva <oliva@lsd.ic.unicamp.br>
  * JMicron responds to USN and several other SCSI ioctls with a
@@ -2109,6 +2172,20 @@ UNUSUAL_DEV(  0x152d, 0x2566, 0x0114, 0x0114,
